    "description": "A complete step-by-step checklist to optimize your YouTube video titles, descriptions, tags, chapters, and thumbnails for maximum organic reach.",
    "content": "YouTube is the second largest search engine on planet Earth, processing over 3 billion searches every single month. Unlike social platforms where posts disappear after 24 hours, an SEO-optimized YouTube video can generate consistent, passive views and subscribers for 3 to 5+ years. Follow this exact step-by-step checklist before hitting publish on every upload. --- ## The Pre-Publish YouTube SEO Checklist ### 1. Keyword Research & Search Intent\n- [ ] Identify 1 primary target keyword phrase using search suggestions or our [YouTube Topic Researcher](/youtube-topic-researcher).\n- [ ] Verify that top-ranking competitor videos have healthy view counts.\n- [ ] Understand the search intent: Does the viewer want a quick tutorial, a deep breakdown, or a product comparison? ### 2. Video Title Optimization\n- [ ] Place the primary keyword within the first 50 characters.\n- [ ] Keep the total length between 50 and 65 characters to prevent mobile truncation.\n- [ ] Include a compelling hook, number, or emotional power word. ### 3. Description Real Estate Optimization\n- [ ] Write a natural, keyword-rich opening summary in the first 2 sentences (these appear in search results).\n- [ ] Write a 200 to 350-word detailed body paragraph explaining the core takeaways of the video.\n- [ ] Add timestamped chapters starting with `00:00` to qualify for Google Key Moments in Google Search.\n- [ ] Generate your full layout instantly using our [YouTube Description Generator](/youtube-description-generator). ### 4. Tag & Hashtag Synergy\n- [ ] Set your primary target keyword as your very first tag.\n- [ ] Include 15 to 20 relevant secondary tags (staying under the 480-character limit).\n- [ ] Add 3 relevant hashtags at the bottom of your description with clean `#CamelCase` formatting.\n- [ ] Use our [YouTube Tags Generator](/youtube-tags-generator) for automatic character-safe tagging. ### 5. Thumbnail & Visual Contrast\n- [ ] Design at 1280x720 (16:9 ratio) under 2MB.\n- [ ] Ensure text overlay is large, high contrast, and 2 to 4 words maximum.\n- [ ] Keep the bottom-right corner clean to avoid being covered by the video timestamp. --- ## Frequently Asked Questions ### Do YouTube descriptions still matter for SEO?\nYes! The first 150 characters are indexed directly in search results, and YouTube's natural language processing models analyze your full description text to understand the context and topic relevance of your video. ### How long does it take for an SEO-optimized video to rank?\nSearch rankings typically settle within 24 to 72 hours after upload. If your video maintains strong retention and positive viewer satisfaction, it can remain ranked at the top of search queries for years.",
